er":false,"text":"看護婦。主人公が憧れる女性。ノリがよく砕けた性格。入院初日に患者を取り違え、主人公にとんでもないことをしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『恥辱診察室』のヒロイン・白川恭子の妹。後の作品『姉汁 〜白川三姉妹におまかせ〜』にも登場している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In 『姉汁 〜白川三姉妹におまかせ〜』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長165cm 体重50kg スリーサイズ-B90/W56/H82"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"次女。看護学生。恭子に劣らぬ豊満ボディの持ち主。少し抜けているが、ノリのいい性格。『ナースにおまかせ』にも出演していたヒロイン。行動力はあるが飽きっぽい性格。エンディングは悠が子供の姿になってネコかわいがられた後結婚するのと、結婚して対等な夫婦になり娘・千晶が産まれさらにもう一人妊娠、という2種類ある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"45884"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"401","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"401","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"401","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"401","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"50 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"401","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f95233a1d09507b14db34531ef350a3f0830166c0b5debad6eb67fa2fcdb80ee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/538ecf8c2c63448aac30c1a5e33f2c158b528039aa77b6f7c3be5b86d7df1779.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116837:45884:4832:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c30716","characterName":"白川 恭子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"45889","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"116837"}],"egsCharacterIds":["819"],"vndbCharacterId":"c30716"},"originalCharacterName":"白川 恭子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"98"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bright, cheerful, and selfish. The terrifying eldest of the Shirakawa sisters, she continuously teases her adorable little brother to the core."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a merciless older sister when it comes to teasing, having enjoyed playing naughty games with Yu since they were little."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30716"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく陽気で自分勝手。可愛い弟には骨の髄までからかい続ける白川三姉妹、恐怖の長女。 幼少の頃から悠にエッチな遊びを実行して楽しんでいたりと、からかいの面では容赦のないお姉さんである。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"819","sourceWorkId":"6824","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"In 『恥辱診察室』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真治就きの看護婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長塚医院長から主人公の監視役を任されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく陽気な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In 『姉汁 〜白川三姉妹におまかせ〜』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長女。看護師。『恥辱診察室』にも出演していたヒロインでナイスバディな体の持ち主。Sでエッチな性格。結構な酒豪、酒乱である。悠が小さい頃に度が過ぎるエッチな遊びをしたことがある。ゲームにおける悠の発言によれば、昔から武道を続けていたらしく、腕力も強い。エンディングは、主人公・悠が恭子を攻めるか・逆に恭子に攻められるかの2種類ある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"45889"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"98 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"819","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"168 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"819","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"819","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"819","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"52 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"819","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80f216042ac0a98a78a4cb2c345d52e6d96c4afb3a77f714b9f7a8b1f1bcb2fd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a56b385323a0ea9e14a37ddcaead7524babd494c3a11ccd5b8442455e84f8c05.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"篁瑞帆","creatorId":"vndb:s3539","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3539","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3539","name":"篁 瑞帆","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116837:45889:25192:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c30718","characterName":"白川 杏子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"45897","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"116837"}],"egsCharacterIds":["820"],"vndbCharacterId":"c30718"},"originalCharacterName":"白川 杏子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"76"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"72"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"49"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Anzu is the serious youngest sister with a rather calm personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she loves her younger brother, she lacks the tolerance of her older sisters and lacks confidence, so she is unable to express her feelings to Yu's face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Furthermore, Anzu feels intense jealousy whenever Yu is teased by her older sisters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30718"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目でどちらかというと落ち着いた性格のお姉さん。弟大好きではあるが、姉達に比べて包容力に欠ける杏子は今ひとつ自信が持てなく、面と向かって悠に優しさを伝えきれていない。さらに、悠がいつも姉達にからかわれる状態に杏子は強い嫉妬心を抱く。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"820","sourceWorkId":"6824","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目でどちらかというと落ち着いた性格のお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弟大好きではあるが、姉達に比べて包容力に欠ける杏子は今ひとつ自信が持てなく、面と向かって悠に優しさを伝えきれていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに、悠がいつも姉達にからかわれる状態に杏子は強い嫉妬心を抱く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『ナースにおまかせ』で、涼子が杏子について、「妹は留学している」と発言している。エンディングは、杏子と悠が一心同体（杏子の体に悠の心が入り込み、両性具有となる）になるものと、過去にさかのぼって、瓶の呪いによる地球滅亡を防ぐ2種類がある。どちらのエンディングでも2人は最後には結婚している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"45897"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"76 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"820","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"820","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"72 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"820","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"49 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"820","sourceWorkId":"6824","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"4